{"version":1,"content":"<p>前女子組合Cookies成員傅穎（Theresa，現名：傅寶誼），早年因「自己嘗試講粗口時打冷震」言論震驚各界，更令佢「一舉成名」，最近佢又提起生活禁忌及性格時，佢認真表示自己非常抗拒粗言穢語，第一次講粗口時更曾全身打冷震。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T10:24:03.738864+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:01:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:13.924522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:13.924522+00:00","content_hash":"c36069f94825982d09a0bd8408ff8949a1f7fc35bef9433263842737bfd2f1cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}